# Commits that blame must look through.
#
# Add a commit here when it changes the shape of the text and none of the
# meaning. A reflow, a re-indent, a formatter run and a quote style change
# all qualify. Do not add a commit that changes behaviour or wording.
#
# git reads this file when you point config at it, once per clone:
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub reads it from the repository root with no config.
# git-why reads it from the root too, so both paths give the same answer.
#
# One full 40 character sha per line. A comment starts with #.
